---
// "Exploring ideas through visuals" block for Section 02 (hubstep case
// study only): a short note on talking with the sales team, two headline
// numbers, and the real project artifacts in public/section-02/ (sales
// input notes, design iterations). (The earlier three-stage
// Requirements / Design exploration / Specification row was removed.)
import EnlargeableImage from '../EnlargeableImage.astro';

const BASE = '/section-02';
const ja = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ja/');
---

<div class="rq">
	<div class="rq-evidence">
		<div class="rq-evidence__eyebrow">{ja ? 'ビジュアルでアイデアを探る' : 'Exploring ideas through visuals'}</div>

		<div class="prose rq-evidence__intro">
			<p>
				{ja
					? 'フローから出てきた疑問点とあわせて、営業ともコミュニケーションを取った。営業が最終的にどのようなインプットや機能を求めているのか、すでにあるハイファイのデザインをさらに良くするにはどうすればよいのかを、やり取りしながら詰めていった。'
					: 'Alongside the questions that came out of the flows, I talked with the sales team: what input and features they ultimately needed, and how the existing high-fidelity designs could be improved further.'}
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="rq-metrics">
			<div class="rq-metric">
				<div class="rq-metric__value">50+</div>
				<div class="rq-metric__label">{ja ? '探索した画面' : 'screens explored'}</div>
			</div>
			<div class="rq-metric">
				<div class="rq-metric__value">20+</div>
				<div class="rq-metric__label">{ja ? '関連するモーダル' : 'supporting modals'}</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="rq-evidence__grid">
			<figure class="rq-evidence__item">
				<EnlargeableImage
					src={`${BASE}/section02-sales-input-notes.png`}
					alt={ja ? '営業からのインプットと機能アイデアをテーマごとに整理したピンクの付箋' : 'Pink sticky notes organizing sales input and feature ideas into themes'}
				/>
				<figcaption>
					<div class="rq-label">{ja ? '営業からのインプットと機能アイデア' : 'Sales input and feature ideas'}</div>
					<div class="rq-caption">
						{ja ? '営業チームからのフィードバックや要望を整理し、具体的なニーズを見つけた。' : 'Feedback and requests from the sales team, organized to identify concrete needs.'}
					</div>
				</figcaption>
			</figure>

			<figure class="rq-evidence__item">
				<EnlargeableImage
					src={`${BASE}/section02-design-iterations.png`}
					alt={ja ? 'hubstepのダッシュボードの2つのデザイン案を、注釈つきで並べたもの' : 'Two hubstep dashboard design iterations shown side by side with annotation notes'}
				/>
				<figcaption>
					<div class="rq-label">{ja ? '進行中のデザイン探索' : 'Design exploration in progress'}</div>
					<div class="rq-caption">
						{ja ? 'プロダクトが具体的になるにつれて、画面とフローをレビューし、注釈を付け、磨き込んだ。' : 'Screens and flows reviewed, annotated, and refined as the product became more concrete.'}
					</div>
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.rq {
		padding: var(--space-4) 0;
		max-width: 100%;
	}

	/* Evidence: plain captions, no cards, no new color. */
	.rq-evidence__intro {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}

	.rq-evidence__eyebrow {
		font-size: var(--text-label);
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.rq-metrics {
		display: flex;
		gap: var(--space-6);
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}

	.rq-metric__value {
		font-size: var(--text-h3);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.rq-metric__label {
		margin-top: 0.25em;
		font-size: 0.875em;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.rq-evidence__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-4);
		margin-top: var(--space-4);
	}

	.rq-evidence__item {
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.rq-evidence__item img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
	}

	@container (max-width: 860px) {
		.rq-evidence__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
